<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications rose 3.9 percent in the week ended June 13, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages rose 16.5 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages inched up 0.8 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index rose 16.5 percent to 375.7 from 322.4 the previous week.</p>
<p>The purchase index advanced 1.8 percent to 210.1 in the latest survey from 206.4 in the previous week.  </p>
